This endpoint is called automatically by the OAuth provider.
The OAuth flow is:
1. GET /authentication/oauth/stateToken?oauthType={id}
2. Redirect user to OAuth provider login
3. Provider redirects back to: /authentication/oauth/redirect?state={token}&code={authCode}

import requests

response = requests.get(
    'https://{orchestrator}/gms/rest/thirdPartyServices/axis/popOverride',
    headers={'Authorization': 'Bearer {token}'}
)
print(response.json())
